# Project: PlaySpace → Owl Practice Sync

## Context
This is a browser automation project that syncs data one-directionally from
PlaySpace Health (pediatric digital therapy platform) to Owl Practice
(therapist EHR/practice management). There are NO APIs for Owl Practice —
all interactions are fully browser-automated using Playwright running in
Browserbase cloud browser sessions.

## Tech Stack
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- Playwright (browser automation)
- Browserbase SDK (@browserbasehq/sdk) for headless cloud browsers
- Zod for runtime schema validation
- Winston for structured logging
- Node.js 20+

## Architecture
- src/browser/ — Browserbase session management and Playwright helpers
- src/playspace/ — Extract data from PlaySpace via browser automation
- src/owl/ — Push data into Owl Practice via browser automation
- src/sync/ — Orchestration, data mapping, deduplication, logging

## Data Flow
PlaySpace (extract) → Mapper → Dedup Check → Owl Practice (push)

Sync order matters:
1. Clients first (other records reference them)
2. Appointments second (session notes attach to them)
3. Session Notes third
4. Meeting Links fourth

## Coding Standards
- Always use async/await, never raw promises
- Every browser interaction must use waitForSelector before acting
- Every page navigation must wait for networkidle or a known element
- Take a debug screenshot on any failure (saved to /debug)
- All data types defined with Zod schemas (not just TS interfaces)
- Structured JSON logging with Winston on every operation
- Never hardcode selectors — use descriptive constants in a selectors file
- Retry transient failures with exponential backoff (max 3 retries)
- Every sync operation must be idempotent

## Error Handling
- Wrap all Playwright interactions in try/catch
- On failure: screenshot → log error with context → continue to next record
- Circuit breaker: if 3+ consecutive records fail, pause sync and alert

## Environment Variables (loaded from .env)
BROWSERBASE_API_KEY, BROWSERBASE_PROJECT_ID, OWL_PRACTICE_URL,
OWL_USERNAME, OWL_PASSWORD, PLAYSPACE_URL, PLAYSPACE_USERNAME,
PLAYSPACE_PASSWORD, SYNC_INTERVAL_MINUTES, LOG_LEVEL
